{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979290/extras/b3c6b6a0ed61c23753f0caf5ca0819be.avif?t=1770141589\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979290/extras_big/b3c6b6a0ed61c23753f0caf5ca0819be.avif?t=1770141589 width=800 height=167 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Orbiteers</strong> is a minimalist puzzle-builder where you design the most efficient space stations across the solar system.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with <strong>L.U.N.A.\u00a0</strong>- your <strong>L</strong>ightweight <strong>U</strong>nbiased <strong>N</strong>arrated <strong>A</strong>ssistant - to solve planetary challenges, optimize your builds, maximize your score, and become the ultimate <strong>Orbiteer</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you accept the challenge?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979290/extras/0c2a194f92829d548f88d1cb625c81f7.webp?t=1770141589\" width=616 height=60 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designing space stations is no easy task. You'll need sharp planning, clever use of limited modules, and a cool head when the stars don\u2019t align.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make the best of your resources, complete objectives, and make L.U.N.A. proud.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979290/extras/4a1e2ac5dfee488177ea6316c2e28535.webp?t=1770141589\" width=616 height=60 /></span> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Earth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >L.U.N.A. has invented a revolutionary new material, and the ideal place to produce it is the vacuum of space. Many ingredients need to be shipped from Earth, making its orbit the best place to set up the factory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Moon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Moon's orbit is home to the remains of the first failed space station. Reclaiming the old station could yield invaluable data on structural decay in orbit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mars</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The red planet is humanity\u2019s best hope for a second home. The construction of a space elevator will reduce transport costs and support colonization efforts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Saturn</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saturn\u2019s rings are a goldmine - literally. Cutting-edge tech enables us to harvest the vast quantities of metal drifting in orbit, essential for humanity\u2019s ambitions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Neptune</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The edge of the solar system holds the key to interstellar travel. Neptune\u2019s composition is perfect for automated fuel production - if the station can withstand the extreme conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979290/extras/b2c2fa26fa6835acc13fecd888147451.webp?t=1770141589\" width=616 height=60 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calming, yet strategic gameplay</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique orbital environments with handcrafted challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of station modules, each with unique requirements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support for relaxed, couch-friendly play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant undo / redo for stress-free experimentation</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Venture forth. The stars are calling.</strong></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2979290/847894a8d93ae8ab8d596444ce49be7645517739.jpg"},{"name":"Isolation Station","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2979290/ba51e04368034702534bcb4858dd7861e2ec5314.jpg"},{"name":"Been There, Done That","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2979290/fa2b33da946ceb10e2a42fd6c9c384e55aea06dc.jpg"},{"name":"Above Them All","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2979290/004da0849ec818637afe8351c1db81821a68f6c6.jpg"},{"name":"Just The Beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2979290/f047518074062e8d3a3a33b73f0bf762fa6a02cc.jpg"},{"name":"Elevator Construction","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2979290/8da07c008c88c3b1ee3b30b681c4a963d841a241.jpg"},{"name":"Living a Miners Life","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2979290/7e6827c21164e1184fb8eb590c8aea2def0af225.jpg"},{"name":"This Station Sucks!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2979290/1de314fceb9503322ad8b33fce7c965fed915cde.jpg"},{"name":"Making Progress","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2979290/100ba3f146f79ba027cdd037c00decf0341828af.jpg"},{"name":"So Far So Good","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2979290/5f88d5df824024a7df378c002ccfd839fb9129cc.jpg"}],"total":22},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2979290?t=1770141589","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979290/9f28cfcd9697caf0c8ceea2199c9152b355b55e4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770141589","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979290/5c802026817c4df9c61eea17a48162a465d59793/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770141589","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979290/5c802026817c4df9c61eea17a48162a465d59793/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770141589","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3804960,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979290/extras/b3c6b6a0ed61c23753f0caf5ca0819be.avif?t=1770141589\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979290/extras_big/b3c6b6a0ed61c23753f0caf5ca0819be.avif?t=1770141589 width=800 height=167 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Orbiteers</strong> is a minimalist puzzle-builder where you design the most efficient space stations across the solar system.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with <strong>L.U.N.A.\u00a0</strong>- your <strong>L</strong>ightweight <strong>U</strong>nbiased <strong>N</strong>arrated <strong>A</strong>ssistant - to solve planetary challenges, optimize your builds, maximize your score, and become the ultimate <strong>Orbiteer</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you accept the challenge?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979290/extras/0c2a194f92829d548f88d1cb625c81f7.webp?t=1770141589\" width=616 height=60 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designing space stations is no easy task. You'll need sharp planning, clever use of limited modules, and a cool head when the stars don\u2019t align.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make the best of your resources, complete objectives, and make L.U.N.A. proud.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979290/extras/4a1e2ac5dfee488177ea6316c2e28535.webp?t=1770141589\" width=616 height=60 /></span> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Earth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >L.U.N.A. has invented a revolutionary new material, and the ideal place to produce it is the vacuum of space. Many ingredients need to be shipped from Earth, making its orbit the best place to set up the factory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Moon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Moon's orbit is home to the remains of the first failed space station. Reclaiming the old station could yield invaluable data on structural decay in orbit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mars</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The red planet is humanity\u2019s best hope for a second home. The construction of a space elevator will reduce transport costs and support colonization efforts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Saturn</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Saturn\u2019s rings are a goldmine - literally. Cutting-edge tech enables us to harvest the vast quantities of metal drifting in orbit, essential for humanity\u2019s ambitions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Neptune</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The edge of the solar system holds the key to interstellar travel. Neptune\u2019s composition is perfect for automated fuel production - if the station can withstand the extreme conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979290/extras/b2c2fa26fa6835acc13fecd888147451.webp?t=1770141589\" width=616 height=60 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calming, yet strategic gameplay</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique orbital environments with handcrafted challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of station modules, each with unique requirements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support for relaxed, couch-friendly play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant undo / redo for stress-free experimentation</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Venture forth. The stars are calling.</strong></h2>","developers":["Northborne Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979290/75034e5d37a49ac1e64f86e431d4282f9e4ae0c8/header.jpg?t=1770141589","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2979290/583360082/ae9bf0bbc9c1f06b756e983e4a179ccc5a9e72a1/1768845632/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768931715","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamsta